00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:49.640
but it's much better than
having to run your own Borgmons.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:52.160
And this gets us to Stackdriver.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.610
AMIR HERMELIN: So in 2014,
we acquired Stackdriver,

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:58.940
and I want to emphasize
that Stackdriver

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:01.170
is a natural evolution
